                    1970-73, SCI 41. No classification marking.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d298-f2" n="2" xml:id="d298-f2-content">
                <p>The letter transmitted a document entitled, “Significant Activities of the
                    Department of State in the Environmental Field.”</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
